\newlabel{fig:LWC_IWC_DER_IER_mixed}{{8}{19}{Same as Fig. \ref {fig:LWC_liq_and_pre_liq}, but for mixed-phase clouds. Seasonal and monthly average of ice water content (IWC) and ice water path (IWP) for mixed-phase clouds. Left panel shows the seasonal median profiles of IWC. Right panel shows the monthly median profiles of IWC and monthly box-plot of IWP in the bottom. For the boxplots, medians are denoted by red lines and the average by black stars.\relax }{figure.caption.13}{}}
